{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy/#webpage","name":"Patrick Conroy: Wealth Manager in New York, NY | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy","description":"Wealth advisor Patrick Conroy in New York offers personalized investment management, retirement planning, and financial strategies tailored to your goals.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69c40703b657c65755a848cc_Patrick%20C%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-25T17:30:33.511Z","dateModified":"2026-03-25T17:30:33.511Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy/#person","name":"Patrick Conroy","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy/#person","name":"Patrick Conroy","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69c406e1143c8e14c16f84e6_Patrick%20C%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy","email":"mailto:patrick.conroy@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"516-268-6076","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"New York","addressRegion":"NY","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/patrickdconroy/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Investment Management","Risk Management","Financial Planning & Analysis"],"description":"Patrick brings decades of perspective from across financial markets, trading, and wealth management. He began his career in financial services after graduating from Columbia University with a degree in Economics. Over the years, he held senior trading and leadership roles at firms including Merrill Lynch, Prudential, Credit Suisse, and Donaldson Lufkin Jenrette.

After spending much of his career on the institutional side, Patrick transitioned into advising because he wanted to work more directly with individuals and families, helping them connect day-to-day decisions with long-term goals. He supports clients with investment and risk management, retirement planning, and financial planning, with a focus on building portfolios thoughtfully while keeping an eye on risk and tax considerations.

Outside of work, Patrick is a lifelong learner with a deep interest in markets. He is married to his high school sweetheart, Karen, and they have four daughters, plus a grandchild, Finnegan. He enjoys skiing, golf, and keeping up with sports."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Patrick Conroy","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/patrick-conroy"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve been in financial services since graduating with a degree in Economics from Columbia University. After two decades in institutional trading and management, I transitioned to the advisory side to help clients with investment and risk management, along with financial and retirement planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with business owners, executives, high net worth individuals, and mass affluent families."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I focus on asking the right questions and drilling down to the “why,” so we can identify goals that are personally meaningful and build a plan that supports them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy removes many of the frictions advisors face, which allows for more client-facing time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work centers on investment management, risk assessment and management, and financial and retirement planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients build and maintain investment strategies with a focus on risk management and tax considerations, while keeping the plan aligned with their broader financial and retirement goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Helping clients live the best life possible with the assets they have available to them."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen/#webpage","name":"Justin Ericksen, CFP®, CFA, AFC®: Wealth Manager in Orem, UT | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen","description":"Justin Ericksen, CFP®, CFA, AFC® is an advisor at Blue Barn Wealth helping individuals and families build financial clarity through planning, investment strategy, and wealth management.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09c2f5e0d8e02864de9ce_2f46bc32b28e461dcfef00304583efaa_Justin%20E%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-09T16:51:31.884Z","dateModified":"2026-03-09T16:51:31.884Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen/#person","name":"Justin Ericksen","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen/#person","name":"Justin Ericksen","honorificSuffix":"CFP®, CFA, AFC®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09c2ec8c56e2e73abe551_Justin%20E%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen","email":"mailto:justin@bluebarnwealth.com","telephone":"+1-801-797-1947","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Orem","addressRegion":"UT","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/justin-ericksen-ms-cfp%C2%AE-cfa-afc%C2%AE-492b1216b/"],"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning & Analysis","Alternative Investing","Tax Optimization","Investment Management"],"description":"Justin Ericksen is an Advisor at Blue Barn Wealth and a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER™ professional. He also holds the Chartered Financial Analyst designation and earned a master’s degree in Financial Planning and Analytics from Utah Valley University.

Justin is passionate about finance and helping individuals succeed. He believes the most important things in life are spending time with the people you love and enriching the lives of others. His planning philosophy reflects those values—helping clients build financial strategies that support what matters most to them.

Outside of work, Justin enjoys spending time with his wife and siblings. His favorite activities include tennis, snowboarding, singing, and playing board games. Justin, his wife, and their dog live in Fairview, Utah."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Justin Ericksen","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor-directory/justin-ericksen"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve always been drawn to finance and the role it plays in shaping people’s lives. I pursued formal education in financial planning and analytics and earned both the CFP® and CFA designations to provide clients with comprehensive, disciplined guidance. I wanted a career where I could help people succeed and make confident decisions about their future."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individuals and families who want clarity around their financial direction—whether that’s building wealth, planning for retirement, managing investments, or navigating life transitions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My background includes comprehensive financial planning, investment management, and long-term wealth strategy. I focus on aligning investment decisions with a broader financial plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients develop personalized investment strategies, retirement plans, tax-aware planning approaches, and coordinated financial strategies designed to support their long-term goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holding both the CFP® and CFA designations allows me to approach planning from both a holistic and analytical perspective. I believe strong financial decisions require both a thoughtful plan and disciplined execution."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Helping clients gain confidence in their financial decisions. When someone feels clear and steady about their financial future, it allows them to focus more fully on the parts of life that matter most."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Partnering with Savvy enhances the tools and support behind the scenes, allowing us to operate more efficiently and deliver a higher level of client service. The additional technology and operational platform enable us to focus even more on thoughtful planning and investment management for the families we serve."}}]}]}
